<title>FINLAND: Finnish March retail volume rises 4.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish March retail volume rises 4.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of Finnish retail sales rose 4.9 percent year-on-year in March, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Friday.  </p>
<p>Adjusted for trading days, the volume of wholesales in March was flat year-on-year, SF said.  </p>
<p>In retail sales, car sales continued to grow in March.</p>
<p>Sales of construction materials and electronic appliances increased in March as well in the first quarter, SF said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
